gufo (0.6.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix clean-install issues found on a bare Debian trixie system:
    - gufo-rocm-repo depends on ca-certificates so the HTTPS AMD
      repository can be fetched on minimal systems.
    - Create the render group when udev's sysusers configuration has
      not, matching the group of an existing GPU device node so mounted
      devices stay accessible (rootful containers).
    - Treat the shared model cache as possibly read-only when it already
      exists, so a read-only cache mount does not fail the install.

 -- Bruno Silva <avlis.onurb@gmail.com>  Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0000

